# The images are built with the repository root as their context. Each Dockerfile copies only
# what it needs, so this list is about speed and about never sending a local secret or a local
# environment to the daemon: a virtualenv or node_modules built on a Mac is the wrong platform
# for the image anyway, and the image builds its own.
.git
**/.env
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
service/.venv
service/.pytest_cache
service/.mypy_cache
service/.ruff_cache
service/.import_linter_cache
**/*.egg-info
editor/playwright-report
editor/test-results
